   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Usually occurs in crops",
   "bbox": [
    62.9,
    217.9,
    146.5,
    228.1
   ],
   "key": "p85-fdc2add4"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e11",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "© University of Cape Town",
   "bbox": [
    93.9,
    298.9,
    158.6,
    306.3
   ],
   "key": "p85-47683fec"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e12",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Insect bites likely • Advise to reduce exposure to insects: treat pets, use bed nets, wash bedding, use insect repellents, clear away puddles of water around house. • Advise to avoid scratching. • Apply calamine lotion as needed. • If severe itch, give chlorphenamine 4mg at night/ up to 6-8 hourly for up to 5 days. • If blisters/heals with darkened skin, papular urticaria likely. Test for HIV 124. Apply hydrocortisone 1% daily for 5 days. For itch, give cetirizine 10mg daily. • If yellow crusts, impetigo likely 93.",
   "bbox": [
    39.7,
    318.6,
    168.6,
    519.5
   ],
   "key": "p85-f7df4bb9"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e13",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Psoriasis likely • Refer/discuss all patients with specialist. • While awaiting appointment: - Test for HIV 124. - Apply liquor picis carbonis (LPC)",
   "bbox": [
    188.1,
    378.3,
    328.8,
    439.3
   ],
   "key": "p85-e0f6cd59"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e14",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "BP 5% ointment once a day or - Apply betamethasone 0.1%",
   "bbox": [
    193.8,
    438.5,
    310.8,
    459.3
   ],
   "key": "p85-6b1f242a"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e15",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "ointment twice a day. Once improving, apply instead hydrocortisone 1% twice a day, then reduce to once a day. Stop as soon as better. • Encourage some sun exposure.",
   "bbox": [
    188.1,
    459.1,
    327.8,
    519.3
   ],
   "key": "p85-aef512b3"
  },
  {
