    303.3
   ],
   "key": "p85-98a3006c"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e24",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "© University of Cape Town",
   "bbox": [
    261.6,
    358.7,
    326.3,
    366.1
   ],
   "key": "p85-5451a9d5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e25",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Advise to keep skin clean, to dry well and avoid sharing towels. • Apply clotrimazole 1% cream 3 times a day (twice a day if on feet). Continue for 2 weeks after rash cleared (at least 4 weeks for tinea pedis). • If surrounding skin red/warm/swollen or if yellow crusts 93. • If extensive or recurrent, test for HIV 124 and diabetes 19. • If extensive or no better after 1 month, refer.",
   "bbox": [
    550.1,
    449.3,
    794.4,
    519.5
   ],
   "key": "p85-5b539f20"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e26",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Pityriasis rosea likely • Reassure that rash will resolve within 2 months. • For itch: - Give chlorphenamine 4mg at night for up to",
   "bbox": [
    345.5,
    442.2,
    529.5,
    483.2
   ],
   "key": "p85-112e4ac8"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e27",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "10 days. Can cause sedation. - If itch no better or severe daytime itch, give",
   "bbox": [
    351.1,
    483.0,
    516.5,
    503.2
   ],
   "key": "p85-8bff0b9b"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e28",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "instead cetirizine 10mg daily.",
   "bbox": [
    356.8,
    502.3,
    471.5,
    513.2
   ],
   "key": "p85-1d72fd69"
  },
  {
   "id": "p85-out-e29",
   "page": 85,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
